TI  - Weak-to-Strong Generalization: Eliciting Strong Capabilities With Weak Supervision
AU  - Burns, Collin
AU  - Izmailov, Pavel
AU  - Kirchner, Jan Hendrik
AU  - Baker, Bowen
AU  - Gao, Leo
AU  - Aschenbrenner, Leopold
